{"channelId":"UCRy6n0f8SpvVliq8FRRjg8g","row":["Campbell Chiropractic Centre - London, Ontario",686,"I believe I was meant to be a Chiropractor. When I graduated, I had the passion and drive to change the world and that passion and drive are as strong as ever today. I want to be a positive influence in people’s lives and help people from the inside out - from a philosophical approach that the human body is amazing and is capable of great healing.\n\nAs a sole female business owner and professional, there have been many challenges. My mistakes have taught me, and my successes have encouraged me. Hearing my patients tell me that they feel better than they have in years, they have their life back and that they are healing from all types of conditions… that it what inspires me to keep going.\n\nwww.campbellcc.com\n\nDr. Michelle Campbell is a Chiropractor and business owner in London Ontario, Canada.\n\nShe is a twin mom to Jackson and Alexandra, and doggy mamma to Jessie.","","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRy6n0f8SpvVliq8FRRjg8g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRy6n0f8SpvVliq8FRRjg8g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:47.542Z","channelId":"UCRy6n0f8SpvVliq8FRRjg8g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"1b1a05538ac8eebf4d2d65065ee47f8a5f42d55eb36bee2e265c4b20df9207a1","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"529e12de37ea1caca2d02fed274ca750f802d797eb755e602f15cecc35338a22"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRy6n0f8SpvVliq8FRRjg8g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:47.542Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRy6n0f8SpvVliq8FRRjg8g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":686,"raw":"686 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRy6n0f8SpvVliq8FRRjg8g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:47.542Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["chiropractors"],"relevantKeywords":["chiropract